  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In 1885 , Balmer for the first time showed that the wave numbers of spectral lines present in the visible region in hydrogen spectrum are given by\r\n$$\r\n\\bar{v}\\left(\\mathrm{cm}^{-1}\\right)=109677\\left(\\frac{1}{(2)^{2}}-\\frac{1}{n^{2}}\\right)\r\n$$\r\nHere, $n=3,4,5, \\ldots$\r\nThus, Balmer spectrum of hydrogen was discovered first and it lies in the visible region.",
